              "name": "post_text",
              "value": "🚀 Exciting news from our team!\n\nWe're thrilled to share our latest innovation in automation technology. This breakthrough will revolutionize how businesses handle their daily workflows.\n\n✨ Key highlights:\n• Increased efficiency by 300%\n• Reduced manual errors\n• Seamless integration capabilities\n• User-friendly interface\n\nWhat automation challenges are you facing in your business? Let's discuss in the comments! 👇\n\n#Automation #Innovation #Technology #Business #LinkedIn #n8n"
            },
            {
              "name": "image_url",
              "value": "https://via.placeholder.com/1200x630/0077B5/FFFFFF?text=LinkedIn+Post+Image"
            },
            {
              "name": "organization_name",
              "value": "Your Company Name"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
